  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "On the canny, I remember being able to easily view all the issues that I have voted on or commented on, but ever since the migration to VRChat accounts, It doesn't seem possible anymore. Navigating and finding issues that you've been interested in is more difficult now than it was before. The only way to tell what issues you've upvoted are ones that you get notifications for. There isn't even a way to easily find what issues you've created without searching the canny as if you have never seen the issue before.",
